  "aboutWhatItDoes": "What it does",
  "aboutWhatItDoesBody": "CatfiSense watches your pond water around the clock. A sensor device in the pond measures the water every few seconds, and this app shows the readings live, keeps their history, and tells you what to do when something drifts out of the safe range.",
