  "recTempLowCritical2": "Reduce or pause feeding — digestion slows sharply in cold water.",
  "recTempLowWarning1": "Reduce feeding frequency slightly while the water stays cool.",
  "recTempLowWarning2": "Watch for sluggish feeding behavior, an early sign of cold stress.",
  "recTempHighCritical1": "Increase aeration immediately and add cooler water if available.",
